Bind Npc 25073 Zone 2

On greeting
    If quest 1241 is started and player has 900670000
        Say "Hello. What is it?"
        Topic "Confirm" do
            Transaction
                Take 1 of 900670000
                Give 1 of 900659000
            Say "Oh. Sadi..sobbing..I have done nothing to deserve this...\n\nThis is not much, but it is some extra money for Sadi.\nCan you deliver this <selfname>?"
    Else if quest 1241 is completed
        Say "Sobbing..my Sadi..Sadi died ...contaminated by the Spiritual Stone.."
    Else
        Say "Sigh...I wonder how Sadi is doing... it's hard to see her face because she's extremely busy working.."
